@startuml

title The states of an adapter as the service sees it

hide empty description

[*] --> Announced : adapter announces\nprovider and universe
Announced --> Ready : universe checked against\nthe installed catalogue
Announced --> Rejected : provider unknown
Ready --> Serving : demand set accepted
Serving --> Serving : demand set changes
Serving --> Ready : demand set empty
Serving --> Stale : heartbeat missed
Ready --> Stale : heartbeat missed
Stale --> Serving : heartbeat returns,\ndemand re-sent
Stale --> Ready : heartbeat returns
Rejected --> [*]

@enduml
